    "body": "According to the HTML5.org’s [Nu Html Checker](https://checker.html5.org/), looks like we still cannot use _multiple_ nested `DIV` elements around `DT`/`DD`:\r\n\r\n<!-- language: lang-html -->\r\n\r\n    <dl>\r\n        <div><div>\r\n            <dt>Lorem</dt>\r\n            <dd>Ipsum</dd>\r\n        </div></div>\r\n    </dl>\r\n\r\nIf this is intentional (hopefully not), this is a huge limitation that makes the feature much less useful.",
